    "Advocates for the nomination have requested that the People's Consultative Assembly (MPR) conduct an open voting process for the appointment."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The political landscape in Indonesia is currently centered on the selection of a new Vice President to serve alongside President Prabowo, following discourse regarding the potential replacement of Gibran. Sugiono has emerged as a prominent candidate supported by a broad coalition of political factions. Key parties such as NasDem have pledged their total support, while Golkar has indicated it will back the candidate preferred by the President. Additionally, members of the DPD RI have voiced their endorsement, with specific requests for the nominee to address regional concerns such as flood mitigation and human trafficking in Aceh. While some factions within the coalition have moved toward formalizing their support, others, including the Democratic Party, are reportedly still consulting with leadership before finalizing their stance on the candidate selection process.",
